OL,3,AGoogle outage hits websites and apps as
OL,4,Asome bank customers report issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle says "multiple" Cloud services
OL,7,Fhave been suffering network failures
OL,9,FIn a message shared on its Cloud Status
OL,10,Fpage, Google says: "We are experiencing
OL,11,Fan issue with multiple services in
OL,12,Feurope-west2", adding that issues began
OL,13,Faround 07:00 BST
OL,15,FThe company says its "engineering team
OL,16,Fcontinues to investigate the issue"
